{
  "$comment": "Which reference to read for a change (plan WP4). Borrowed routes (../<skill>/references/<file>.md) take when and triggers from the owning skill's routes.json, so they cannot drift. audience: report only rules for these audiences; name every other rule in a borrowed reference in lenses.md. Render the SKILL.md table with node tools/bin/render-routes.ts.",
